    <briefdescription>
<para>Public API of the Baton bus library. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This module groups the public interface and its supporting submodules: <ref refid="group__baton__config" kindref="compound">Configuration</ref>, <ref refid="group__baton__defs" kindref="compound">Definitions</ref>, <ref refid="group__baton__protocol" kindref="compound">Codec</ref>, <ref refid="group__baton__link" kindref="compound">Link</ref>, <ref refid="group__baton__queue" kindref="compound">Event queue</ref> and <ref refid="group__baton__node" kindref="compound">Node</ref>.</para>
<para>Include this single header to use the library: <itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><ref refid="baton__config_8h" kindref="compound">baton_config.h</ref> build-time sizes and the application message lists </para>
</listitem>
<listitem><para><ref refid="baton__defs_8h" kindref="compound">baton_defs.h</ref> frame layout, frame types, control-byte and byte-order helpers </para>
</listitem>
<listitem><para><ref refid="baton__protocol_8h" kindref="compound">baton_protocol.h</ref> CRC-16, incremental parser, encoder </para>
</listitem>
<listitem><para><ref refid="baton__link_8h" kindref="compound">baton_link.h</ref> half-duplex link: receive ring, parser timeout, transmitter </para>
</listitem>
<listitem><para><ref refid="baton__queue_8h" kindref="compound">baton_queue.h</ref> event queue (used by the node) </para>
</listitem>
<listitem><para><ref refid="baton__node_8h" kindref="compound">baton_node.h</ref> master/slave node: events, states, schedule </para>
</listitem>
</itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
